:: Home_Bathroom_Alone [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>I lock a door that doesn&apos;t really need locking, in an apartment where I live completely alone. Habit more than necessity.</p>

<p>It doesn&apos;t take long, it never does when it&apos;s just about function, five minutes of not thinking about rent or loans or the DashDrop app or anything at all, which is honestly the entire appeal. Efficient and unglamorous, a pressure valve rather than an event.</p>

<p>Afterward I feel marginally more human, which is a low bar but one I clear anyway.</p>

</div>

